# A track started from nothing mid-loop enters at the next whole beat,
# which becomes its start point; its later versions take over at its
# own boundaries (5, 8 here), not at the other track's.
open virtual
track 1 60:4
play continue
runto 1.3
track 2:2 72:3
state
runto 5.5
track 2 74:3
runto 9
log
state
